--- !u!114 &411501433
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 411501431}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1718eac66ebf767aab40af1fff90f629, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _text: {fileID: 1751919021}
  _pageIndicator: {fileID: 728587998}
  _trainingPages:
  - '<b><size=130%>ROUNDS & PROGRESS</size></b>\n  The game consists of multiple
    rounds. After each round, press Play to start the next one. Your progress is
    automatically saved between rounds. '
  - <b><size=130%>TIME & HEALTH</size></b>\n  Your time is your health. Each round
    starts with a set amount of time on the clock. Taking damage reduces your remaining
    time. If it hits zero, the round ends. Time resets each round, though the amount
    may vary.
  - <b><size=130%>DAMAGE</size></b>\n  Certain objects in the game deal damage, subtracting
    seconds from your remaining time. Stay alert and choose your path carefully.
  - '<b><size=130%>ROOM WITH PASSAGES</size></b>\n  One room contains two passages.
    The purple passage deals -20 seconds of damage. The orange passage is safe and
    costs nothing. '
  - <b><size=130%>ROOM WITH DOORS</size></b>\n  One room contains two doors. The
    right door triggers a minigame that upgrades your weapon, but costs time. The
    left door is a free pass with no cost and no reward.
  - <b><size=130%>MINIGAME</size></b> \n  The minigame shows a spinning wheel. Press
    SPACE when the arrow is in the green section to score a hit. Fill all the slots
    to complete the minigame and upgrade your weapon.
  - <b><size=130%>BOSS FIGHT</size></b> \n The final room of each round contains
    a boss. Defeat it before your time runs out. Each hit from the boss costs -10
    seconds. The boss resets to full health each round. Your boss kill count is shown
    in the top right corner.
  - <size=200%><b>GOOD LUCK!</b></size>
  _testPages:
  - <size=200%><b>Change of some rules!</b></size>
  - <b><size=130%>MINIGAME CHANGE</size></b>\n The minigame no longer provides a
    weapon upgrade. However, choosing to play it still costs you time. The left door
    remains a free pass.
  - <b><size=130%>PASSAGES CHANGE</size></b>\n The passages have switched. The orange
    passage now deals -20 seconds of damage. The purple passage is now safe to pass
    through. Stay alert, the colors are swapped!
  - All other rules remain the same. Time is still your health, the boss resets each
    round, and your progress is saved automatically. Press Play after each round
    to continue.
  - <size=200%><b>GOOD LUCK!</b></size>
